sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant WP as WordPress plugin
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant G as LangGraph
  participant AI as Gemini
  participant LF as Langfuse
  WP->>API: POST /chat + X-API-Key<br/>{question, session_id, visitor hash}
  API->>API: key (401), validation (422),<br/>daily budget (429)
  alt first turn, answer cached
    API-->>WP: cached answer + sources<br/>(no model calls)
  else run the graph
    API->>G: ainvoke(thread_id = session_id)
    G->>AI: analyze (Flash-Lite)<br/>route + standalone question
    G->>AI: query embedding<br/>(cached in SQLite)
    G->>G: hybrid search, top 6 chunks
    G->>AI: answer from the chunks (Flash)
    G-->>API: answer, used chunks, route
  end
  API--)LF: trace: steps, models, tokens
  API-->>WP: {answer, sources[], cached, trace_id}
